{"id":"n41233-3-6","stage":4,"title":"넘나들다 · 交往","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41233-3-6-1","ko":"이웃이랑 꽤 친한가 봐요?","zh":"看来你和邻居挺要好的啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이웃이랑","meaning":"邻居，邻里","explanation":"이웃：邻居，邻里；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31487","senseId":"2","lemma":"이웃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이웃이랑","audio":"/audio/238ed6dac0ade766570e.mp3"}},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还。","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}},{"text":"친한가","meaning":"亲近，要好，亲密","explanation":"친하다：亲近，要好，亲密；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"친하다","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80614","senseId":"1","lemma":"친하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친한가","audio":"/audio/d81e0ffee1f4ab6dcfc0.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요?","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"56a0fd1527d12237","term":"이웃","zh":"邻居，邻里","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3","entryId":"31487","definition":"与自己的家邻近的家；或居住在那个房子里的人。","pronunciation":["이욷"]},{"id":"130a398219d202b0","term":"꽤","zh":"颇，相当，还","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3","entryId":"38264","definition":"预期或期待以上，相当。","pronunciation":["꽤"]},{"id":"0275722d7b511a47","term":"친하다","zh":"亲近，要好，亲密","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3","entryId":"80614","definition":"近交相知，感情深